WEBVTT

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:04.440
Wait! The gong hasn't rung yet.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.120
We're finally here.
I have no use for this mask now.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.420
No...

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.050
It can't be...!

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.390
Elena?!

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.060
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:41.230
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:49.860
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:03.130
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:08.630
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:14.260
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:19.310
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:24.860
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:30.240
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.110
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:39.790
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.500
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:45.710
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:50.800
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.640
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.720
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:04.230
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:12.020
Episode 11: Pure Soul!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:13.920
Wh-What's going on here?!

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:18.010
On the wrestling ring is
the former Sweet Diva duo...

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:23.600
Hagiwara Sakura, and Miyazawa Elena!

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:31.190
The mysterious, masked Blue
Panther facing Hagiwara Sakura

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.610
has revealed herself
to be Miyazawa Elena!

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.780
B-But why?!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.200
Why...?

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:41.740
Why are you here... Elena?!

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.700
It's to get you back into Sweet Diva!

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:49.120
If I win, you're going
to retire from pro wrestling!

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:50.170
But...

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.130
But, this isn't right!

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:54.670
I want to know how serious you are.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:58.180
If you want to
continue wrestling, just beat me!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.470
And, if that happens

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.930
I want you completely out of Sweet Diva!

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:05.350
Without that kind of determination,

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:08.440
there's no meaning
to continue pro wrestling!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.440
Start the match!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.360
Elena, wait!

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.530
The gong has just rung!

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.240
The two who fought on stage as idols

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.450
are now fighting as wrestlers!

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.040
Was this their destiny?!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.800
C'mon, put the squeeze on!

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.670
Okay! Rope break!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:04:00.070
What a natural flow into the hold!

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:05.200
Is this really the top idol, Miyazawa Elena?!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.210
Miyazawa Elena first came to us

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:16.420
a week after Hagiwara
Sakura's challenge to Kazama Rio.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:21.630
She came believing she was
at fault for Hagiwara Sakura's

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:25.390
entry to pro wrestling,
and that she has to experience

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.390
the same pains as her.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.770
Elena stood behind her intention.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.560
Despite her surreal schedule as an idol,

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.610
she sacrificed her time

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:39.280
and trained each coming day.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:45.450
Soon, her spirit made me
train her as a true wrestler.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:49.160
I wanted to answer to her resolve.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.790
But...

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.430
Wow, Elena-<i>chan...</i>

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:13.060
Elena must have trained hard...

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.700
But... But why...?

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.490
O-Owww...!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.330
S-Sakura...

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:36.040
Rio-<i>san</i>, Sakura's being pushed, right?

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:39.250
I know it isn't easy facing her, but...

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:43.590
that aside, Miyazawa
Elena is simply talented.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.180
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:46.970
Do your best!

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.680
The pain...!

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:56.390
Rope!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.360
That hurt...!

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.360
One...!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.990
Two...!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:17.290
Miyazawa took advantage
of the escape from the pin!

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:21.290
Miyabi's wrestling style is
putting the pressure on Hagiwara!

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.760
Despite Hagiwara's win against Kazama Rio,

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:28.510
she still announced her
intent to continue wrestling.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:33.890
Elena took that as words of
her separation from Sweet Diva.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:37.310
That Hagiwara will never return...

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:40.230
She then made a decision.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:44.280
To bring back Hagiwara Sakura herself.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:47.650
If she spurred Hagiwara
to enter pro wrestling

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:51.410
then she had to get
her back to an idol too.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.950
From that day, Miyazawa
Elena became the Blue Panther

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:59.290
and started practical training at Miyabi.

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:03.090
Now her training wasn't
to feel Hagiwara's pains...

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.920
She trained to defeat
her, and bring her back.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.520
She's surprisingly awkward...

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:25.690
and sadly, just as pure.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.490
I see...

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:34.450
You acted as Blue Panther
in place of Miyazawa Elena...

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:38.460
You did all that for her because...

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:44.210
...you saw your old self
in Miyazawa Elena, right?

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:47.840
Sanada Juri and Toyoda Misaki...

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.550
Miyazawa Elena and Hagiwara Sakura...

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:54.390
The awkwardness is
the same among all of you.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.730
Miyazawa Elena isn't
letting her guard down!

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.190
Hagiwara is only on the defense!

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:13.620
Sakura!

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.700
How much longer are you
planning to fight like that?!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.790
Misaki-<i>san...</i>

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.290
She's serious here!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.000
Why aren't you serious too?!

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.290
But, Elena's my friend, and...

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.840
Then even more so!

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:30.720
If she's your friend,
answer back with all you've got!

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.930
If you want to continue
wrestling, move forward!

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.600
You're going to be the
strongest in the world, right?!

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:42.230
Sakura!

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.440
Yes!

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:10.260
An ankle lock to a crossed heel hook!

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:15.470
The move strains the heels,
so it's not used by Berserk

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.800
but this is Miyabi's ring!

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:20.770
It hurts...!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.850
This is going to spell
trouble if she doesn't get out!

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:38.320
Owww...! Owww...!

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:49.830
Ouch! Ow! Owww....!

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:52.540
Okay! Rope break!

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.710
Sakura...

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.220
Misaki-<i>san</i>!

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.810
Why you...!

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.940
The kneebar got locked in!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.900
Miyazawa is putting
the squeeze on Hagiwara!

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:23.740
That's one painful move!

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:27.160
Owww...!

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:30.870
Hagiwara! Give up?!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.330
No... No...!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.540
Give up, Sakura?!

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.170
No...!

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.840
Ouch...!

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:49.600
Hagiwara, give up?!

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:50.810
No...!

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.180
Hagiwara is enduring with all she's got!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.770
With retirement at stake in this match,

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:59.310
she can't give up so easily!

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:02.980
Give up?!

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.150
No...!

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.780
No?!

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.540
I won't let you!

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.210
I'm going to end this here, Sakura!

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.840
Owww...!

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:29.970
Hagiwara is struggling
her way towards the ropes!

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:37.730
But Miyazawa is twisting
Hagiwara's left knee against the joint!

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.480
Owww...!

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:43.940
Do your best, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.490
Over here!

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.320
A little more! Just a little more!

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:51.370
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.540
Rope! Referee! The rope!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.670
Okay! Rope break, Miyazawa!

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:02.000
- Rope! Rope!
- Rope!

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:03.710
Miyazawa! You're breaking the rules!

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.340
One!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:10.800
Hagiwara escapes quickly out of the ring!

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:12.720
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>...!

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:18.600
Miyazawa went into
the kneebar outside the ring!

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:22.810
What persistence! What is
driving Miyazawa's resolve?!

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:25.690
Sakura...

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:29.450
Why you...!

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:30.950
You idiot!

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.280
Don't do it, Moe!

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:36.120
Fights outside the ring are
allowed for twenty counts!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.750
But...!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.130
- It hurts...!
- Ten!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.460
Eleven!

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:50.090
Twelve!

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.720
Sakura!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.350
Thirteen!

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:56.810
- Fourteen!
- I can't take this much longer...

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:59.230
I might not be able to endure...

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:01.390
- Fifteen!
- ...the next kneebar...

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:02.560
Sakura!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:05.110
She'll try to get you the
moment you get in the ring.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:06.110
Be very careful!

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.190
- Sixteen!
- Y-Yes...!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:15.410
Instead of Miyazawa
spinning into the hold,

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.910
she put the kneebar
on falling backwards!

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:20.660
What a display of skill entering the hold!

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.290
No...!

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:26.170
Ouch! Ow, ow, ow!

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:31.300
A barrage of kneebars on
the knee! What persistence!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:33.010
Give up?!

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:33.840
No...!

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:36.260
No?! Even with this?!

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:38.930
No!

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:40.350
Give up?!

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:41.350
No...!

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:43.560
Come on, give up! Give up!

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:50.610
Sakura, please give up!

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:54.410
If I keep this up,
I'm going to hurt you bad!

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:55.820
I'm...

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:59.080
I'm never going to give up...!

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:02.330
Rope! Referee! Rope!

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.710
Okay! Rope break!

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:11.920
This isn't a cat fight between idols.

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.260
That's damn real wrestling!

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.800
You're pretty good, Miyazawa Elena!

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:20.560
All right! Show us more of your moves!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.180
Elena...!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.480
E-le-na!

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:27.230
- Don't you lose, Hagiwara!
- E-le-na! E-le-na!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:28.440
Sakura-<i>chan</i>...!

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:34.200
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:37.490
This is awesome! What an amazing stage!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.330
Elena...

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.250
Elena... you're...

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:52.050
Juri...

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:56.510
I can hardly feel a thing.

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.550
My legs aren't going
to hold if this keeps up...

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:04.060
All or nothing... This is my last chance...!

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:05.980
Another kneebar

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:08.860
and her leg is going to fail.

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:10.730
She needs to make a move!

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:15.700
Hagiwara steps forward,
but she's wide open!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.570
Sakura! Watch out!

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:19.200
No...!

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:22.200
Now!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.420
Referee! I got the pin!

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:31.250
Hey ref! Get with the count!

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.460
One...!

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:35.090
Two...!

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:39.510
Miyazawa escapes with
a two and a half count!

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:44.220
It may have ended the match
if the referee counted sooner!

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.310
This is too close for comfort...

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.480
I suppose tricks aren't
enough to hold her down.

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:07.870
Ouch!

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:09.330
The damage to my knees...!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.960
Sakura!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.360
Rope!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:41.610
Okay! Rope break!

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:55.960
Hagiwara lays on the
kneebar right back at her!

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:58.010
It's on good!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:16:59.970
Give up?!

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:01.090
No...!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.140
No?

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:04.140
How about this!

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:10.770
Rope!

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:14.520
Sakura... So this is how strong you are.

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:16.900
Not being able to show her identity,

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:20.400
and living two lives
as a wrestler and an idol,

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:23.610
put a damper onto
Elena's match experience.

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:27.910
Real strength is supported
by one's experiences.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:32.120
That's Miyazawa Elena's
one and only weakness.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.750
Referee! The pin!

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.550
One...!

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:40.170
Two...!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.180
One...!

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:52.810
Two...!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.520
Miyazawa is barely on her feet!

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:02.030
But that should be the
same for Hagiwara as well!

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:06.570
Wait! Hagiwara's stance is there...!

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:14.080
Ouch!

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:15.710
Sakura! Pin her!

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.750
One...!

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.670
- Two...!
- Two...!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.050
With the toll taken on Hagiwara's knees,

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:28.850
her Sakura Special wasn't at its full force!

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:43.190
- One...!
- One...!

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:45.240
- Two...!
- Two...!

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:47.110
That should've been a three!

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:16.350
That hit high!

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.600
Hagiwara's amazing!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:25.570
- One...!
- One...!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.200
- Two...!
- Two...!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.490
- One...!
- One...!

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:34.830
- Two...!
- Two...!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.250
Th...

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:38.250
That was close!

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:46.010
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.470
I'll finish this...!

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.230
The Juri Crash!

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:09.780
No! Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.370
The cornered Miyazawa pulled off

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.580
the Juri Crash to the Spider Hold,

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:17.960
Sanada Juri's special combo!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:22.080
Why you...!

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:30.800
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:36.140
E-le-na! E-le-na! E-le-na!

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:43.310
Sakura-<i>chan...</i>

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.840
Hagiwara? Give up?!

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:14.800
Hagiwara! Are you okay?!

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:16.640
I'm going to stop the match!

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:17.930
Hagiwara?

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:19.560
Hagiwara!

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:34.990
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:37.540
No...!

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:43.040
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.630
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:50.460
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:53.340
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:57.760 --> 00:22:03.020
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:08.650
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:08.860 --> 00:22:14.110
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:18.200
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:19.330
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:22.000
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:24.670
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:32.050
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:38.180
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:39.390
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:41.020
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:49.110
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:50.730
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:50.940 --> 00:22:54.700
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:55.950
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:56.160 --> 00:22:57.490
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:57.700 --> 00:22:59.990
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:01.450
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:05.040
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:07.880
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:34.930
Episode 12: To the World!

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:12.620
Do your best, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:23:12.830 --> 00:23:15.210
You're a real pro wrestler now!

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:17.170
Come back against any challenge

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:19.590
to win them all!

00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:21.920
C'mon Chief! Cheer her on!

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:26.050
Sakura-<i>chan</i> is going
to set out into the world!

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:29.930
But there's a big
decision she needs to make first.

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:33.020
Is Sakura-<i>chan</i> going
to continue pro wrestling?

00:23:33.230 --> 00:23:34.520
Or is she...?

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.940
A request from Sakura:

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.940
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
